<title>USA: CONNECTICUT $260 MLN GO DEAL RESTRUCTURED.</title>
<headline>CONNECTICUT $260 MLN GO DEAL RESTRUCTURED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
